  "body": "The request of the maintainer (relayed 2026-11-17, quoted in #2392): \"have it setup a bunch of examples.. for debugging..\" - \"a good way of testing the various operations\".\n\n## What\n\nAdd the case `examples/catalog/turning/groove-part-off`: a bar with an outside groove (Groove Rough, Groove Finish), then Parting.\n\n## Notes\n\nMachine: `assets/machines/lathe.mch`. #2394 shows Facing, Profile Rough, Profile Finish and Threading.\n\nDone means: The case folder obeys `examples/catalog/README.md`: `model/` with its generator script, `build.camscript`, `<case>.camproj`, `<case>.nc` and `README.md`. The geometry is original (Clean-Room Protocol). `cargo xtask catalog --check` and `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog` pass. The README says what the case shows and what to look at. The posted program shows the groove plunges and the part-off.\n\nFile each refusal or wrong output that the work finds as its own bug. Link the bug on #2392. A missing parameter in an MCP tool is a new `area:mcp` issue.\n\nPart of #2392\n",
